//! `step` — a high-level 3D modelling DSL and a STEP (ISO 10303-21)
//! parser/serializer.
//!
//! The library is layered:
//!
//! 1. A faithful core (`crate::entities`, `crate::parse`, `crate::repository`,
//!    `crate::header`, `crate::cad`) that mirrors the reference
//!    implementation.
//! 2. A beautiful facade (this module) whose free functions and receiver
//!    methods read well inside a `|>` pipeline.
//! 3. Compatibility aliases in `crate::cad::deprecated` for the original API.
//!
//! Gossamer has no `pub use`, so consumer-facing names are `pub type` aliases
//! and forwarding free functions, added as each layer lands.

#[cfg(test)]
use crate::tests

